Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: phy: apple,atcphy: Add t8122 and t8132

The M3's Type-C PHY needs its own setup, so it gets its own fallback
compatible. The M4's is compatible with the M3's.

Signed-off-by: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/apple,atcphy.yaml | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/apple,atcphy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/apple,atcphy.yaml
index 0acac7e3ee67..d6162fd4788d 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/apple,atcphy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/apple,atcphy.yaml
@@ -55,6 +55,10 @@ properties:
               - apple,t8112-atcphy
           - const: apple,t8103-atcphy
       - const: apple,t8103-atcphy
+      - items:
+          - const: apple,t8132-atcphy
+          - const: apple,t8122-atcphy
+      - const: apple,t8122-atcphy
 
   reg:
     items:
